# Conservative first-release allowlist. Local research material remains on disk.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/pages.yml
!/publication/
/publication/*
!/publication/sites/
/publication/sites/*
!/publication/sites/v1/
!/publication/sites/v1/**
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/publication_sites/
!/src/publication_sites/**
!/outputs/
/outputs/*
!/outputs/sites_publication_data/
/outputs/sites_publication_data/*
!/outputs/sites_publication_data/20261004_v1/
!/outputs/sites_publication_data/20261004_v1/**
!/outputs/sites_publication_delivery/
/outputs/sites_publication_delivery/*
!/outputs/sites_publication_delivery/20261004_v1/
!/outputs/sites_publication_delivery/20261004_v1/**

# Always local, including inside otherwise allowed directories.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.research_deps/
.mplconfig/
.idea/
.vscode/
.env*
*.log
*.har
*.part
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.aws/
**/.ssh/
**/.codex/
**/.agents/
**/vault/
**/private_vault/
**/recovery_vault/
**/signing_key
**/signing.key
**/*.private.key
**/*.secret.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/cookies*.json
**/session_export*
**/credentials

# Reviewed accepted engineering logs are part of the explicit first release.
!/outputs/sites_publication_data/20261004_v1/*.log
!/outputs/sites_publication_delivery/20261004_v1/*.log
